  "verseCount": 57,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pek kuäärä Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk gat Gi-don wä kä Cɛ-kɛm kä ji̱ maarä man kɛ ji̱ thuɔk duëël cieŋ näridɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Latdɛ jɛ ji̱th ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm diaal i̱, ‘Ɛ mi̱th gɔaa ɔ kä yɛ, ɛ ba yɛ ruac ɛ gaat Gi-don ti jiɛn bärɔw, kiɛ ɛ ɣöö ba yɛ ruac ɛ ram kɛl?’ Kä ŋa̱cɛ jɛ bä ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän kuɛ̈ɛ̈dun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ maarä man laat ti ti diaal la̱t ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm diaal kɛ kui̱dɛ. Kä cukɛ jɛ nhɔk ɛn ɣöö ba Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk guɔ̱ɔ̱r, kɛ ɣöö laar kɛn ɛ i̱, “Ɛ dämaara.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ moc kɛ yio̱w ti jiɛn bärɔw duëël kuɔth Baal-bɛ-rith tin cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk kɛ ben kɔk ni nɛy tin thil luɔt kä /ci riɛk ala ji̱ kɔaarɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wä dhɔr gua̱n kä Ɔp-ra, kä cuɛ gaat man wä näk gaat Gi-don ti jiɛn bärɔw wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m kɛl. Duundɛ ɣöö cu Yo-tham gat in tɔtdiɛn kä Gi-don kään kɛ ɣöö cɛ rɔ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ wec diaal kä Cɛ-kɛm rɔ dol, nikɛ ji̱ Beth-mil-lo diaal, cukɛ Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk wä jak kä kuäär thaar jiaath ëë ci Jɔ-cua päm la̱th thi̱n kä Cɛ-kɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca jɛ la̱r Yo-tham, cuɛ wä cuɔ̱ŋ wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m Gɛ-ri-dhim, cuɛ wiee kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Yɛn ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm, liɛŋɛ ɣä, dɔŋ bi Kuoth yɛ liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cäŋ kɛl cu jiɛn rɔ dol kɛ ɣöö bikɛ rɔ kuëny kuäär. Kä cukɛ jiath Ɔ-lip jiök i̱, ‘Ruac nɛy.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jiath Ɔ-lip kɛ jiök i̱, ‘A bä liɛɛthdä ku päl, min la ka̱m kɛ kuth kɛnɛ naath, kɛ ɣöö bä yɛ wä ruac?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jiɛn jiath ŋɔa̱a̱p jiök i̱, ‘Ji̱n bër, ruac nɛy.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jiath ŋɔa̱a̱p ɛ loc i̱, ‘A bä ku päl ni gɔɔydä, kɛnɛ liɛm dɛɛnikä, kɛ ɣöö bä ruac ni yɛ?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jiɛn beel jiök i̱, ‘Bër, bër ruac nɛy?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, ‘A bä ku päl ni kɔaŋdä min la kuth kɛnɛ naath lo̱ckiɛn a jak kä tɛth, kɛ ɣöö bä yɛ wä ruac?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jiɛn diaal rup kuiyni jiök, ‘Bër, bër ruac nɛy?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, ‘Mi lot yɛn ni jɛ kɛ lɔc mi gɔaa a ba̱a̱ kuäär kä yɛ, kä bia lua̱kɛ rɔ ti̱pädä. Kä mi /ciɛ jɛn inɔ, kä ɛ mac bä raar kuiinikä mi bi bua̱w Lɛ-ba-nɔn ben waŋ?’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inɔ täämɛ mi cia lät agɔaa kɛ lɔc ŋäthä mi thuɔ̱k kɛ kuënydun kɛ Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk ala kuäär, kä cia lät agɔaa kɛ ji̱ dhɔaar Gi-don, ce̱tkɛ min dëë lät kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kɛ ɣöö ci gua̱a̱r ko̱r tɛr kɛ kui̱dun kä cɛ tëkdɛ thöp, kä cɛ yɛ kän tetni ji̱ Mid-yan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn walɛ cia rɔ riet dhɔr gua̱a̱r, a cia gaatkɛ näk, gaatkɛ ti jiɛn bärɔw cia kɛ näk pääm kɛl, kä jak yɛn Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk gat läkä ciek kä kuäär Ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm, kɛ ɣöö marɛ kɛ yɛ.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn walɛ mi la̱tdɛ agɔaa kɛ lɔc ŋäthä mi thuɔ̱k kɛ Gi-don kɛnɛ dhɔrɛ, a lɔcdun tɛth kɛ Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk, kä bi lɔcdɛ tɛɛth kɛ yɛ bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi /ciɛ jɛn inɔ, a mac bä raar kä Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk mi bi ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm kɛnɛ ji̱ Beth-mil-lo pɛt, kä a mac bä raar kä ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm kɛnɛ ji̱ Beth-mil-lo, mi bi Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk pɛt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yo-tham rɔ bar, kä cuɛ wä cieŋ kä Bɛɛr, kɛ ɣöö dualɛ kɛ däman ni Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ run diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth mi jiääk la̱th kam Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk kɛnɛ ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm. Cu ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm lät a jiäk kɛ Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuɔɔk nɔmɔ kɛ kui̱ gan Gi-don ti jiɛn bärɔw tëë ca näk, ɛ riɛmdiɛn bä kä Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk dämandiɛn ëë näk kɛ kɛnɛ ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm tëë cuɔm kɛ jɛ i̱ bɛ gaat man näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk moc kɛ naath ti nyuɔ̱rkɛ jɛ ikä dup wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m, kä cukɛ nɛy tëë wä kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p ɛ mɔ mac. Kä cua la̱r Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
