          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Gaal gat Ɛ-bɛd ɣo̱th kä Cɛ-kɛm kɛnɛ ji̱ maarädɛ. Kä cua jɛ ŋäth ɛ ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wä rɛy ka̱a̱kni, wäkɛ ŋɛɛr kɛ bua̱c ti ba ben lät ni kɔaŋ rɛy ka̱a̱kni walkiɛn kɛ kui̱ kɔaŋ, kä cukɛ wä rɛy luaak kuɔthdiɛn, wa cäŋ bälä tim. Cukɛ mi̱th kä cukɛ maath, kä cukɛ Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk kuëth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Gaal Gat Ɛ-bɛd wee, “Ɛŋa ɛn Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk, kä kɛ kɔn ŋaani kɔn ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm, mɔ dënɛ jɛ lät ikä mɔ? Ciɛ gat Gi-don kɛnɛ Dhɛ-bul bo̱o̱th nɛɛnikɛ, lätdɛ ni ji̱ Ɣä-mor gua̱n Cɛ-kɛm ikä? Ɛŋu mi dënɛ jɛ lätikä kɛ jɛ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ mi tekɛ tetädä! Dëë Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk jak kä ci te thi̱n. Dëë jiök i̱, ‘Cio̱o̱li nɛɛku raar kɛn diaal.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Dhɛ-bul kuäär wec ruac Gaal gat Ɛ-bɛd liŋ, cuɛ gaak ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ naath jäk kä Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk kɛ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ jio̱kɛ jɛ i̱, “Nɛnɛ, Gaal gat Ɛ-bɛd cɛ ben kä Cɛ-kɛm kɛnɛ watkɛ, kä ca wec ben jëc cuɔ̱ŋ kɛ kui̱du. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ ku wä ɛn wääri, yɛnɛ nɛy tɔ̱ te kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ tɔ̱, wiaa tɔ̱a̱wɛ rɔ rɛy ka̱a̱kni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikɛ runwaŋ ni po̱o̱tdä, kua wec ma̱k. Mi wä Gaal wä ben raar kä yɛ kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ, la̱tdɛ kɛ kä mɔ dërɛ luäŋ kɛ lätni mɔ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk kɛnɛ nɛy diaal tin te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ rɔ̱ jiɛc kɛ wäär, cukɛ rɔ̱ wä tɔ̱w gekä Cɛ-kɛm kɛ buɔ̱n da̱ŋ ŋuaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Gaal gat Ɛ-bɛd wä cuɔ̱ŋ raar thok wec. Cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk rɔ jiɛc kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ guäth in bi̱m kɛ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci Gaal naath nɛn, cuɛ Dhɛ-bul jiök i̱, “Guicɛ naath a bëë piny ni nhial wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m!” Kä cu Dhɛ-bul ɛ loc i̱, “Ji̱n guici ni ti̱eep päämni ɛ ji̱n dɔ̱ŋ kɛ naath.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Gaal rɔ nyɔk kɛ ruac wee i̱, “Guicɛ naath bäkɛ piny kueer, kä buɔ̱n in dɔ̱ŋ bëë kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p jiaath in la tueth ti̱t thi̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Dhɛ-bul ɛ jiök i̱, “Min latdi a nikä täämɛ, ji̱n ram mëë wee, ‘Ɛŋa ɛn Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk, min dënɛ lätikä?’ /Cikɛ kɛn nɛy tin ci dhɔt i̱? Wër ɛn täämɛ nyieenyni kɛ kɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Gaal wä nyiëëny kɛ Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk kɛnɛ ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk ɛ joc, cuɛ nɛy ti ŋuan moc kɛ buɔ̱ɔ̱t amäni mëë cikɛ cop thok wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk cieŋ kä Thɔr-ma. Kä cu Dhɛ-bul Gaal tuk kɛnɛ watkɛ kä Cɛ-kɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ bakdɛ cu naath wä rɛy ka̱a̱kni. Kä cua Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk la̱r lär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ nɛɛkɛ ka̱n kä cuɛ kɛ dääk kä bun da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, kä cukɛ wä li̱ep rɛy ka̱a̱kni. Cuɛ guic, kä cuɛ naath nɛn bäkɛ wi̱c, cuɛ jiëc kɛ, kä cuɛ kɛ näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ kɛ näk i̱ nɛ, cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk kɛnɛ buɔ̱n in tëë thi̱n wä thaar wec, guäth in nyiëëny bun da̱ŋ rɛw kɛ nɛy diaal tin ci rɛy wä ka̱a̱kni kä cukɛ kɛ näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk nyiëëny kɛ wec ɛn cäŋ ëë. Cuɛ wec ka̱n, kä cuɛ ji̱ kɛ diaal tin te thi̱n näk. Cuɛ jɛ däk, kä cuɛ kith kɛ milɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ thar biikä diaal kä Cɛ-kɛm ɛ liŋ, cukɛ wä rɛy duëli kuɔth El-bɛ-rith tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk la̱r lär i̱ ji̱ thar biikä Cɛ-kɛm diaal ca rɔ dol guäth kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk wä Pääm Dhal-mon, kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ tin tekɛ jɛ kɛɛl. Ɛn wi̱ni cuɛ jio̱p ka̱n, kä cuɛ jɔp kɛ kar jiath. Kä cuɛ kɛ kap kɛ wuɔ̱ɔ̱kdɛ. Kä cuɛ nɛy tin te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Mi guic yɛn ɛ mi ɛ la̱tdä, kɛ pɛ̈th la̱tdɛ jɛ ce̱tnikɛ min cä la̱t.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu ramɔ jiɛn kɛ jɔp, kä cukɛ jɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r, cukɛ jiɛn la̱th wuɔ̱thni duëli tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m, kä cukɛ kɛ cua̱th wi̱i̱diɛn, kä cu ji̱ biikä Cɛ-kɛm diaal li̱w, nɛy ti bathdɔɔr, wutni kɛnɛ män.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk wä kä Te-bedh, kä cuɛ pua̱t lotdä Te-bedh, kä cuɛ ka̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö tëë kɛ biɛɛ mi bum bum ɛn wec, cu ji̱ wec diaal rɔ bar thi̱n, wutni kɛ män, kä cua rɔ ga̱k thi̱n. Cukɛ wä kɛ wä ni wi̱i̱ biikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ biikä, cuɛ ben thiekä thuɔk biikä kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ waŋ kɛ mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tekɛ ciek mi cu pil yuɔr wi̱i̱ Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk, kä cuɛ wi̱cdɛ tiath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ pɛ̈th cuɛ ŋuɛ̈t in rɔm mutdɛ cɔl, kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Käni thɛpdu kä näk ɣä, mäni mi dëë naath wee, ‘Näkɛ ni ciek’ ” Kä cu ŋuɛ̈t ɛ yiɛth ni jicdɛ, kä cuɛ cu li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ nɛn i̱ ci Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk li̱w, cukɛ däk piny cu ramɔ wä dhɔriɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Kuoth Ä-bi-mɛ-lɛk cu cuɔ̱l duerɛ mëë näkɛ gaat man ti jiɛn bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth dueer ji̱ Cɛ-kɛm la̱th wi̱i̱diɛn, kä cu lam Yo-tham gat Gi-don ben kä kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
